<div class="Story">
<div class="Story-section">
    <h4 class="Story-title">Base (a parcel that left, with its carrier page and delivery note)</h4>
    <p class="Story-label">
        One parcel of an order shipped in several, as the order page of the account shows them,
        one card per parcel above the products. The lines are listed as quantity and title:
        whether they get the full product card is not decided yet, which is why the component
        waits in the toolkit.
    </p>
    <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--roomy">
        <twig:Organisms:Shipment:Base
            :shipment="{
                ref: 'ORD000000000042-1',
                status: 'shipped',
                deliveryRef: '6A12345678',
                deliveryModuleTitle: 'Colissimo',
                trackingUrl: 'https://carrier.example/track?parcel=6A12345678',
                shippedAt: '2026-10-13T10:00:00+00:00',
                orderShipmentItems: [
                    {quantity: 2, orderProduct: {title: 'Mesh running shoes', productRef: 'SHOE-42'}},
                    {quantity: 1, orderProduct: {title: 'Cotton socks', productRef: 'SOCK-7'}},
                ],
            }"
            :position="1"
            :total="2"
            deliveryNoteUrl="#"
        />
    </div>
</div>
<div class="Story-section">
    <h4 class="Story-title">Base (a parcel still being prepared)</h4>
    <p class="Story-label">
        No tracking number yet and no carrier page: the card says the parcel is being prepared
        and lists what it will carry.
    </p>
    <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--roomy">
        <twig:Organisms:Shipment:Base
            :shipment="{
                ref: 'ORD000000000042-2',
                status: 'draft',
                deliveryRef: null,
                deliveryModuleTitle: 'Colissimo',
                trackingUrl: null,
                shippedAt: null,
                orderShipmentItems: [
                    {quantity: 1, orderProduct: {title: 'Rain jacket', productRef: 'JACKET-3'}},
                ],
            }"
            :position="2"
            :total="2"
        />
    </div>
</div>
<div class="Story-section">
    <h4 class="Story-title">Remaining (what no parcel has taken yet)</h4>
    <p class="Story-label">
        Under the parcels of an order shipped in several: each line that still has to leave,
        with the quantity owed. Computed from the order payload (lines, parcels and their
        items); a cancelled parcel holds nothing, a service line and a virtual product never
        ship. Renders nothing before a first parcel exists or once everything left.
    </p>
    <div class="Story-stage Story-stage--roomy">
        <twig:Organisms:Shipment:Remaining
            :order="{
                orderProducts: [
                    {id: 1, title: 'Mesh running shoes', productRef: 'SHOE-42', quantity: 3, virtual: false, lineType: 'product'},
                    {id: 2, title: 'Cotton socks', productRef: 'SOCK-7', quantity: 1, virtual: false, lineType: 'product'},
                    {id: 3, title: 'Rain jacket', productRef: 'JACKET-3', quantity: 1, virtual: false, lineType: 'product'},
                ],
                orderShipments: [
                    {status: 'shipped', orderShipmentItems: [
                        {quantity: 2, orderProduct: {id: 1}},
                        {quantity: 1, orderProduct: {id: 2}},
                    ]},
                ],
            }"
        />
    </div>
</div>
</div>
